      "support_status": "SUFFICIENT",
      "rationale": "These spans supply the roster-linked observation period and general stopping limits without specifying their precedence."
    }
  },
  "signal_basis": {
    "component_id": "C011.signal_basis",
    "value": "Track waiting, returns to active work and time to publication, including publication near a previously stated roster date; retain accounts with no return or incomplete follow-up in reporting.",
    "scope": "Prospective onboarding observation, with roster-linked follow-up and censoring of unfinished trajectories. Roster-date proximity is an observational signal, not identification of a cause.",
